                                    <img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBWNufBJf9h0_ozJY8LZUy4FMPLEE36mZPfb91Nlg6IAykttMuJM6_Z3gwQQ8GHfPvvfFGbwMbUoztsZ0a3eEUhX6m-btpOUfWB0PdMXbIyW2mf2fdqv5ZUVSacvkQ3HEXD13wk-hyFaBcMo2Oqdu4ZzxermRUKbHiWYr_92yDXDww_65eRkzHHrmp4NZAgnoshGQaoyOKYijH4h2mEN0QoWFrowmSrhN2rwIhuX-7kvFJyxtOvsCHdlvPepUF8O9SHtZfGzeWFqsJ0"/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="p-stack-md">
                                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                                        <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-[20px] text-on-surface">Royal Seafood Set</h4>
                                        <span class="text-primary font-bold">1.250k</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm line-clamp-2 mb-4">Sò điệp Hokkaido áp chảo, Tôm hùm Nha Trang sốt bơ tỏi, Rượu vang trắng...</p>
                                    <button type="button" class="w-full py-2 border border-primary text-primary font-label-lg rounded hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-all">Thêm vào yêu cầu</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <!-- Set Menu 2 -->
                            <div class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/50 transition-all bg-white">
                                <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden">
                                    <img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAJdKO0tcl1nyLHB2rwoj7hSJRg2Tu4DQ7Aq3cl_8E1ya2SCt3nIhr5txllTVfDDnwlP--IBWbKXysEd586usSQNaFjDYVSy-1bLSPZSBCY1IkpMh19t7F2fjiGIW3lOfYSSb-wRXDHryb4hQ3yNvBVjsmPK-TlKixUaTONvryGNkHr6GzPzBBwmtvboyHrw6KJxxVAnhnGhBr-OBHMc60YfhVRnLlX2oPZO6Yvu_rsS7K0JgUde9rnE151Q6zqZeo4Bwuj-zCD67lV"/>
                                </div>
                                <div class="p-stack-md">
                                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                                        <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-[20px] text-on-surface">Fusion Harmony</h4>
                                        <span class="text-primary font-bold">950k</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm line-clamp-2 mb-4">Thăn bò Wagyu nướng than hồng, Súp nấm Truffle, Tráng miệng Sorbet chanh...</p>
                                    <button type="button" class="w-full py-2 border border-primary text-primary font-label-lg rounded hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-all">Thêm vào yêu cầu</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="mt-stack-lg pt-stack-lg border-t border-outline-variant/20">
                            <h4 class="font-label-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-4 uppercase tracking-tighter">Món đặc trưng (A-la-carte)</h4>
                            <div class="space-y-4">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-outline-variant/10">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-dim">
                                            <img class="w-full h-full object-cover" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAH85P7YeBg5g-o4JktLyUO4ofUxyvTredeTtSuYYSetHYm7cqIphChhNxXy1EBI0MovGp8ZPBdhWqZcbCM8G3qPiq46P7Q_my334dZyOfFVPRJkyNFeSs15oCRoMTBAaIoHgBjwt9udcJCcOzvysbAamzpueO0fBiXdMjAOZJjurlTvXsaAi8Ururn-IIA0QbWH7_EVGYszYiNcrklSe8R8iEjOSPLtUFu4ROGFR7XMhXu3QpcgYVtukNzpFl3ljgbLQhOzgMb9ae0"/>
                                        </div>
                                        <div>
                                            <p class="font-label-lg text-on-surface">Gỏi cá mai Phan Thiết</p>
                                            <p class="text-[12px] text-on-surface-variant">Kèm bánh tráng và nước chấm đặc sản</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                                        <span class="font-bold text-primary">220k</span>
                                        <button type="button" class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container add-alacarte-btn">add_circle</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-outline-variant/10">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-dim">
                                            <img class="w-full h-full object-cover" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCmhTGsidk4n4kNA8jxLMKbAWw73D8qrNgeuw22-HZGNGcnMizSQYEZRhGiGdOY6c3JgqXxWsv9ClAiMRaDUPdZwcy3Mh5KsuXmUzSJo24L8mvul14Yh5TfymnmbjNq0z1xZxouT6QmNHtOom8eMEa-14AQ4LImBsnd9EPFYme1SkNutfYVLcsXGVcieKacWWRlzxUSTl44-M7w9rh800OyrD8T8KdwATK_Nie4iEwG3dRExKe39SnjBswN7Vz5AUNImRneQ-EC3Rfo"/>
                                        </div>
                                        <div>
                                            <p class="font-label-lg text-on-surface">Cua Huỳnh Đế hấp gừng</p>
                                            <p class="text-[12px] text-on-surface-variant">Chế biến theo yêu cầu riêng của quý khách</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                                        <span class="font-bold text-primary">1.800k</span>
                                        <button type="button" class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container add-alacarte-btn">add_circle</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                </div>

                <!-- Right Column: Sidebar Summary -->
                <aside class="lg:col-span-4 sticky top-28">
                    <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-xl luxury-shadow overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="h-40 overflow-hidden relative">
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.ImageUrl))
                            {
                                <img class="w-full h-full object-cover" src="@Model.ImageUrl" alt="@Model.TableName" onerror="this.src='/images/placeholder.jpg'"/>
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                <img class="w-full h-full object-cover" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBu-u168YV_cu9PrXeNc__PbFaeJLSUVBC_KX-VmiF91uiOYtL-barE_AkZN4P3yZBqikwao6JmuEijlqZjsRH2PFhxgRvoKka29gM_3DzC282VH4w9-2FmBCQl0n9XhBCsesrol7vbxEYQu_TWXR9eB8iXzLBWZQ-9d8ZYcHFjXFDPPcV0Y1DTQNUxWtEykihHJb7HUdgOAiJrn11V3nGLh9TPdYw12QiYQOtNSiV6s3ORvMWBHPJ_tlfaZK8Ew2maOfg0wDdxPKbl"/>
                            }
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent flex items-end p-stack-md">
                                <h3 class="text-white font-headline-sm">@Model.TableName</h3>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="p-stack-lg space-y-6">
                            <div class="space-y-4">
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mt-1">location_on</span>
                                    <div>
                                        <p class="font-label-lg text-on-surface-variant">Vị trí đã chọn</p>
                                        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface font-semibold">@Model.Area</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mt-1">calendar_month</span>
                                    <div>
                                        <p class="font-label-lg text-on-surface-variant">Thời gian</p>
                                        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface font-semibold">@Model.ReservationTime.ToString(@"hh\:mm"), @Model.ReservationDate.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mt-1">groups</span>
                                    <div>
                                        <p class="font-label-lg text-on-surface-variant">Số lượng khách</p>
                                        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface font-semibold">@Model.PartySize Người</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="border-t border-dashed border-outline-variant/40 pt-6">
                                <h4 class="font-label-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-4 uppercase tracking-tighter">Yêu cầu bổ sung</h4>
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                                    <span class="font-body-md text-on-surface">Món chọn trước</span>
                                    <span class="font-bold text-on-surface" id="selected-menu-count">0</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mt-2">
                                    <span class="font-body-md text-on-surface">Phí dịch vụ (10%)</span>
                                    <span class="font-bold text-on-surface">Miễn phí</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="bg-surface-container p-4 rounded-lg">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-primary">
                                    <span class="font-label-lg uppercase font-bold">Tổng tạm tính</span>
                                    <span class="font-headline-sm" id="total-price-text">0đ</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant mt-2">* Thanh toán tại nhà hàng sau khi dùng bữa. Một số món đặt trước có thể yêu cầu đặt cọc.</p>
                            </div>
                            
                            <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container py-4 rounded-xl font-label-lg text-headline-sm-mobile shadow-lg shadow-primary-container/20 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-95 transition-all">
                                Xác Nhận Đặt Bàn
                            </button>
                            
